WEBVTT

00:01.007 --> 00:02.842
Over here.

00:02.884 --> 00:05.386
J-Jotaro! L-Look!

00:05.428 --> 00:08.180
Watch it, Koichi!
Don't get any closer!

00:09.390 --> 00:13.435
Hey, I said look over here.

00:25.073 --> 00:26.449
Is that his Stand?!

00:26.491 --> 00:27.825
J-Jotaro!

00:29.202 --> 00:32.955
H-He's here!
He's taking the jacket!

00:34.123 --> 00:35.415
Good grief.

00:35.458 --> 00:37.710
Of course he comes to
get his suit now…

00:40.129 --> 00:41.505
Our evidence!

00:41.589 --> 00:42.423
Wait!

00:42.882 --> 00:44.633
We can't just blindly pursue it.

00:50.431 --> 00:51.974
This Stand…

00:55.561 --> 00:57.062
Careful… It's gonna blow!

01:19.085 --> 01:19.794
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:19.794 --> 01:21.962
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

01:22.005 --> 01:24.340
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

01:24.382 --> 01:27.635
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

01:28.386 --> 01:30.513
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

01:30.555 --> 01:32.890
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

01:32.974 --> 01:36.185
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

01:36.436 --> 01:39.939
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

01:40.732 --> 01:44.152
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

01:44.193 --> 01:46.820
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

01:46.863 --> 01:49.031
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

01:49.073 --> 01:51.075
<i>I will chase you</i>

01:51.159 --> 01:52.785
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

01:52.827 --> 01:55.412
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

01:55.496 --> 01:57.539
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

01:57.582 --> 02:00.293
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

02:00.501 --> 02:05.001
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

02:06.174 --> 02:10.674
<i>So I chase you</i>

02:15.058 --> 02:19.061
EPISODE 23
HEART ATTACK, PART 1

02:17.643 --> 02:20.980
CENTIPEDE SHOES

02:27.153 --> 02:30.030
It's a bomb…
It's a bomb Stand!

02:30.323 --> 02:33.326
So this is how
he got Shigechi…

02:33.659 --> 02:36.703
That's why we couldn't
find him anywhere.

02:39.874 --> 02:42.209
He's… He's getting away!

02:42.251 --> 02:44.253
Let him go, Koichi.

02:44.337 --> 02:46.589
Huh? Let him go?

02:46.839 --> 02:48.382
What are you saying?

02:48.424 --> 02:49.800
If we go after him,

02:49.842 --> 02:51.927
we'll be able to catch
a glimpse of the monster

02:51.969 --> 02:53.804
who slayed Reimi and Shigechi!

02:54.347 --> 02:58.726
We carefully observe the situation,
then make our move, Koichi.

03:00.061 --> 03:02.229
Do you hear yourself?

03:02.355 --> 03:06.108
Sorry to say, I never got
a look at his name on that tag.

03:06.359 --> 03:08.361
But considering
the size of that jacket,

03:08.569 --> 03:10.946
I can tell
he's about 175 centimeters tall.

03:11.197 --> 03:14.033
He's an office worker,
and definitely not hitched.

03:14.242 --> 03:15.284
Otherwise,

03:15.451 --> 03:18.120
he wouldn't have brought his jacket in
for a measly button.

03:19.122 --> 03:23.622
He's between 25 and 35,
not to mention pretty damn rich.

03:24.377 --> 03:28.297
That fabric and design,
that's a luxury designer jacket.

03:28.673 --> 03:30.549
Even without a good look at him,

03:30.758 --> 03:33.552
we just narrowed
our target down big time.

03:33.594 --> 03:35.220
Oh, that makes sense…

03:35.263 --> 03:38.349
No way! So we just throw up
our hands and wait?

03:38.433 --> 03:40.059
He's a cold-blooded killer!

03:40.601 --> 03:42.853
It's not a choice, we can't.

03:43.020 --> 03:46.189
That bomb Stand
is somewhere over there.

03:46.357 --> 03:48.150
Huh?! The Stand?

03:49.694 --> 03:51.612
Y-You saw it?

03:56.075 --> 03:59.203
No, but I know it's here.

03:59.787 --> 04:02.664
Slowly we make our way
out the door.

04:03.124 --> 04:05.584
You know? Just hang on a second.

04:05.626 --> 04:08.545
How can you know its location
if you can't see it?

04:08.629 --> 04:10.005
If he were the kind of killer

04:10.089 --> 04:12.299
to up and run after offing
only that shop owner,

04:12.467 --> 04:15.511
there would've been no way
he could've kept killing

04:15.595 --> 04:17.054
for fifteen years.

04:17.138 --> 04:19.223
This bastard leaves
no evidence behind.

04:19.891 --> 04:22.435
Which means he intends
to take us out too.

04:23.686 --> 04:27.898
Wait… Don't you think
you're being a little too careful?

04:28.191 --> 04:30.026
<i>If his Stand isn't here,</i>

04:30.067 --> 04:34.154
<i>our murderer and
evidence could be long gone by now.</i>

04:34.238 --> 04:35.489
Listen, Koichi.

04:35.990 --> 04:39.243
Observing involves
more than just looking.

04:38.201 --> 04:39.535
LOOKING

04:39.327 --> 04:40.766
It means scrutinizing everything.

04:39.619 --> 04:40.745
SCRUTINIZING

04:41.454 --> 04:44.394
You don't just listen,
you concentrate.

04:41.829 --> 04:43.288
LISTEN

04:43.331 --> 04:44.373
CONCENTRATE

04:45.666 --> 04:46.750
Otherwise,

04:47.835 --> 04:50.087
we die here in this room.

04:51.506 --> 04:56.006
<i>I don't think I like his tone…
It's not like Reverb isn't capable.</i>

04:56.552 --> 04:58.554
<i>He's matured a lot.</i>

04:58.596 --> 05:02.391
<i>Maybe Mr. Jotaro just
doesn't take me seriously…</i>

05:02.642 --> 05:06.228
It sure doesn't look like
that bomb Stand is still around.

05:06.521 --> 05:09.649
Then we'd be the chumps,
wouldn't we!

05:11.108 --> 05:12.734
Over here.

05:12.818 --> 05:15.237
<i>I-It was here all along!</i>

05:15.321 --> 05:17.239
<i>I-It'll explode if
I keep touching it!</i>

05:17.240 --> 05:18.699
Star Platinum!

05:36.342 --> 05:38.052
I knocked the shit out of that thing…

05:38.094 --> 05:40.554
and it still managed to
stay in one piece.

05:42.223 --> 05:43.557
It's gonna blow!

05:43.558 --> 05:45.810
Star Platinum! The World!

05:47.395 --> 05:49.355
I prefer not to break a sweat,

05:49.397 --> 05:52.400
so I'll dispose of you
right here and now.

06:12.044 --> 06:15.172
Y-Yes!
You must have stopped time.

06:15.631 --> 06:18.133
Then, it doesn't matter
how much you touch it!

06:26.434 --> 06:30.104
Anyone who dares pursue
Yoshikage Kira

06:30.396 --> 06:32.606
shall perish by explosion.

06:32.898 --> 06:36.902
Once my Deadly Queen's Heart Attack
finds its prey,

06:36.944 --> 06:40.405
it won't stop until it makes its kill.

06:46.954 --> 06:50.999
Holy shit! Even Star Platinum
couldn't destroy it!

06:51.125 --> 06:53.502
It's indestructible…
How the hell!

06:53.544 --> 06:55.087
Get back, Koichi.

07:10.811 --> 07:12.187
It isn't damaged!

07:12.271 --> 07:14.606
Nothing seems to phase
this thing at all!

07:14.649 --> 07:16.275
Get back, Koichi!

07:17.026 --> 07:19.862
Y-You've hit him
so hard you're bleeding,

07:19.904 --> 07:21.989
and it's still totally fine!

07:22.031 --> 07:24.533
Get far away, Koichi!

07:29.580 --> 07:31.290
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow.

07:31.332 --> 07:32.958
What are you doing?!

07:33.084 --> 07:37.046
It'll explode if you touch it!
Get rid of that thing, fast!

07:55.272 --> 07:57.607
Over here.

07:57.983 --> 08:02.483
Good grief. This is definitely a first…
this Stand's resilience is insane.

08:03.072 --> 08:06.325
My confidence is going
to break before it does.

08:06.492 --> 08:10.204
J-Jotaro, at this rate,
he's gonna blow us to smithereens!

08:10.454 --> 08:11.955
You're still way too close.

08:12.123 --> 08:14.291
I'm gonna dismantle
this alarm clock from hell for good.

08:14.375 --> 08:16.335
You gotta listen to me.

08:16.544 --> 08:18.337
Stands controlled from afar

08:18.379 --> 08:20.589
wield only a marginal amount
of power.

08:20.631 --> 08:23.925
The way it charges,
the power of its explosions…

08:24.009 --> 08:28.179
There's no way its user
isn't nearby.

08:28.222 --> 08:32.722
At the very most he's fifteen…
no, ten meters away!

08:32.977 --> 08:34.019
And?

08:34.061 --> 08:36.146
"And"?! It's ten meters!

08:36.230 --> 08:38.440
My Reverb has
a range of fifty meters!

08:38.482 --> 08:39.941
I know I can find that prick!

08:40.067 --> 08:43.403
I told you, Koichi.
Don't go after him.

08:43.779 --> 08:48.279
Your job is to focus on
protecting your own hide with Reverb.

08:48.451 --> 08:50.161
Everything else
is unnecessary.

08:50.578 --> 08:51.954
W-Why?!

08:52.705 --> 08:54.748
Our murderer is no longer close by.

08:54.999 --> 08:57.251
We're dealing with
a long-range Stand.

08:57.585 --> 09:00.462
I've seen enough of these freaks
of nature to know.

09:00.838 --> 09:02.548
Over here.

09:02.923 --> 09:05.884
Its movements are too simple
for a short-range stand.

09:06.093 --> 09:07.969
<i>He's seen enough of them?</i>

09:08.053 --> 09:09.804
<i>But that doesn't make
any sense!</i>

09:09.889 --> 09:13.017
<i>An overwhelmingly powerful
long-range Stand…</i>

09:13.142 --> 09:15.394
<i>The user has to be close by!</i>

09:15.478 --> 09:18.647
<i>So Mr. Jotaro really
doesn't take me seriously</i>

09:18.898 --> 09:20.691
<i>I've matured, too!</i>

09:20.941 --> 09:23.818
<i>I can locate and destroy him!</i>

09:26.697 --> 09:28.323
Distance, ten meters.

09:33.621 --> 09:36.707
<i>There! That's him!
He has the jacket!</i>

09:39.960 --> 09:42.629
<i>I don't get it…
H-He's too faraway.</i>

09:42.671 --> 09:45.131
<i>He's more than fifty meters away…</i>

09:45.174 --> 09:46.884
<i>He keeps walking away.</i>

09:46.967 --> 09:49.094
<i>He's outside Reverb's range!</i>

09:49.428 --> 09:52.180
<i>Th-The bomb Stand is
a long-range Stand?</i>

09:52.264 --> 09:53.181
<i>That can't be!</i>

09:53.224 --> 09:56.018
<i>That kind of power
with a long-range Stand is impossible!</i>

10:07.112 --> 10:09.197
Over here!

10:09.281 --> 10:11.283
W-What? He's charging toward me?!

10:11.325 --> 10:12.451
Now I've got it.

10:12.493 --> 10:16.288
It's drawn to whichever object
it detects is hottest.

10:16.539 --> 10:19.750
That's how a long-range Stand
can be so powerful.

10:20.459 --> 10:21.877
Summon Reverb and
protect yourself!

10:22.127 --> 10:24.379
Stopping time is no use,
you're too far away!

10:24.463 --> 10:26.006
<i>C-Crap!</i>

10:26.048 --> 10:27.340
Reverb is…

10:28.300 --> 10:32.262
fifty meters away with
the killer!

10:32.638 --> 10:35.474
Please forgive me!

10:35.516 --> 10:37.226
Good grief.

10:38.185 --> 10:40.228
Star Platinum! The World!

10:48.863 --> 10:52.157
He attacked the shop owner first

10:52.241 --> 10:55.035
because he was holding
a cup with hot liquid.

10:55.244 --> 10:56.828
It targeted Koichi because…

10:56.871 --> 10:59.248
his agitated state had risen
his body temperature.

10:59.665 --> 11:03.543
If it detects something hotter,
it should go after that.

11:04.086 --> 11:05.754
Time resume.

11:10.217 --> 11:11.635
I was right.

11:11.760 --> 11:15.930
It's drawn to the highest temperature
it can detect.

11:16.056 --> 11:17.766
Thank goodness…

11:17.850 --> 11:21.270
But if body temperature
is enough to set it off,

11:21.353 --> 11:23.021
then fire will make it…

11:25.524 --> 11:26.775
This power…

11:27.067 --> 11:28.068
Huh?!

11:41.707 --> 11:45.293
Mr. Jotaro!

11:50.341 --> 11:53.052
HEART ATTACK

12:00.434 --> 12:04.813
How could I let this happen?
This is all my fault, Mr. Jotaro!

12:07.024 --> 12:09.359
All because I went
after that bastard.

12:09.401 --> 12:11.403
This would've never happened

12:11.445 --> 12:13.905
if he hadn't stopped time and
started a fire to save me!

12:13.948 --> 12:15.824
Wake up, Jotaro!

12:16.575 --> 12:20.120
Jotaro! Jotaro!

12:21.580 --> 12:25.959
That wasn't human flesh exploding!

12:27.586 --> 12:29.838
Over here.

12:34.134 --> 12:36.344
It's gonna kill us!

12:36.428 --> 12:38.680
It's too strong!

12:51.151 --> 12:53.069
It's just like Jotaro said!

12:53.153 --> 12:55.071
If it detects something hotter
than body temperature,

12:55.155 --> 12:56.531
it'll go after that first.

12:56.573 --> 12:58.575
Over here.

12:58.701 --> 13:00.619
Now's my chance to run!

13:00.661 --> 13:02.788
I've got to call Josuke.

13:02.830 --> 13:05.415
He'll make Mr. Jotaro all better!

13:05.499 --> 13:07.626
I have to phone him…
I have to let him know!

13:12.756 --> 13:15.216
Of course… the kitchen!

13:15.259 --> 13:17.052
Plenty of opportunity for fire!

13:17.177 --> 13:19.888
I'll buy some time and
escape out that door.

13:20.431 --> 13:21.557
There's a phone!

13:26.562 --> 13:30.732
W-Wait a sec!
It's not a gas stove!

13:30.774 --> 13:33.234
Why the hell does this house
have an electric stove?!

13:33.318 --> 13:35.403
It'll take forever to warm up!

13:35.487 --> 13:37.113
The oven's electric, too!

13:39.283 --> 13:41.159
<i>W-What can I do…</i>

13:41.869 --> 13:43.745
That's it! There's always
an electric kettle with hot water.

13:44.079 --> 13:45.747
Try and find me now!

13:48.709 --> 13:50.168
It's empty!

14:04.266 --> 14:06.685
Over here.

14:12.775 --> 14:17.112
Wait. It's like Mr. Jotaro said…
carefully observe…

14:17.196 --> 14:19.448
This thing has a weakness!

14:19.907 --> 14:22.284
I never noticed it!

14:24.495 --> 14:26.788
Besides, you're starting
to piss me off.

14:28.082 --> 14:31.835
Why should some punk killer
have the satisfaction of

14:31.919 --> 14:36.419
watching me flee the scene
begging God for mercy?

14:36.799 --> 14:38.467
Shouldn't roles be reversed?

14:38.675 --> 14:41.469
I know I can get out
of this alive.

14:41.595 --> 14:43.805
So why am I standing here
thinking I'd rather be

14:43.847 --> 14:47.433
running to the crapper with
a bad case of the shits?

14:47.935 --> 14:49.811
I had it all wrong.

14:50.104 --> 14:52.064
The one running away like
a scared little bitch…

14:52.356 --> 14:55.984
is you, the murderer!

14:57.236 --> 15:00.364
You're unrelenting in
your pursuit of thermal energy…

15:00.447 --> 15:04.947
But that's also your shortcoming!

15:05.244 --> 15:08.538
Your inability to stop will
be your ultimate undoing!

15:12.459 --> 15:14.836
It's been almost three minutes.

15:14.962 --> 15:18.173
I don't know what has transpired
at that shoe store,

15:18.507 --> 15:22.135
but if there's one thing
I'm certain of,

15:22.678 --> 15:26.098
it's that Heart Attack
has no weaknesses.

15:27.266 --> 15:30.686
It will track down and
destroy its target.

15:31.770 --> 15:35.732
Now, then… With him out of the way,
I need to phone Josuke.

15:36.525 --> 15:38.944
He should be home now…

15:45.784 --> 15:48.745
SIZZLE

15:48.871 --> 15:51.623
He's lost us now.

15:51.665 --> 15:56.165
That "sizzle" should keep you
busy for a while…

15:56.795 --> 15:58.546
Kinda like a donkey chasing

15:58.589 --> 16:01.383
a carrot hanging from a stick
in front of its nose.

16:02.301 --> 16:04.511
That, sir, is your fatal flaw.

16:04.720 --> 16:06.722
<i>Hello, Higashikata residence.</i>

16:06.847 --> 16:09.724
Josuke, it's Koichi! I need help!

16:09.766 --> 16:11.392
Jotaro's hurt bad and,

16:11.476 --> 16:14.061
I hate to say it, but I'm at fault.
Just get here fast!

16:16.231 --> 16:18.524
<i>What?! I need a second
to process!</i>

16:18.567 --> 16:19.943
<i>What the hell's going on!</i>

16:20.027 --> 16:22.612
Just focus on getting here asap.
It finally happened!

16:22.696 --> 16:24.406
We found the murderer!

16:24.448 --> 16:26.658
I'm holding his Stand captive
here now.

16:26.742 --> 16:28.660
You're holding what captive?!

16:28.702 --> 16:31.871
Speak up so I can hear you!
Where are you?

16:32.664 --> 16:34.415
W-What the…?

16:35.375 --> 16:38.044
Ow, hot! I turned this thing off
a while ago,

16:38.086 --> 16:40.713
and now it starts to heat up.

16:40.881 --> 16:42.757
What's with this heap of junk?

16:42.841 --> 16:45.218
How the hell does anybody cook
with this thing?!

16:45.260 --> 16:48.972
<i>Hey! Koichi,
tell me where I can find you!</i>

16:53.560 --> 16:55.687
Over here.

16:56.355 --> 16:58.690
Crap! It's ignoring Reverb's
writing and charging this way!

16:58.732 --> 17:02.152
<i>Koichi, where are you?
Hurry up and tell me, you idiot!</i>

17:02.236 --> 17:04.905
Centipede Shoes! Hurry quick!

17:05.697 --> 17:08.533
Damn, it still has part
of Reverb's tail…

17:13.580 --> 17:15.456
He blew it up!

17:15.540 --> 17:16.958
The damage transferred to me…

17:18.794 --> 17:22.339
That wasn't human flesh exploding.

17:22.506 --> 17:24.341
Over here.

17:24.925 --> 17:28.219
It's at it again!
It's charging me again.

17:28.262 --> 17:30.806
But now I can't use my tail
to transform into writing.

17:30.847 --> 17:32.473
Now what?

17:32.557 --> 17:34.600
How can I fight back?

17:41.483 --> 17:43.526
Reverb Act 2!

17:50.617 --> 17:53.953
What's wrong, Reverb Act 2?!

17:53.996 --> 17:55.747
Act 2!

17:57.291 --> 18:00.127
Where are you, Act 2?!
Why won't you appear?!

18:03.046 --> 18:06.966
Act 2… It got him with his bomb!

18:07.009 --> 18:09.177
It split him completely apart!

18:10.887 --> 18:12.930
N-No, wait…

18:13.015 --> 18:17.269
If it killed him in the blast,
I'd be dead too; I'm the user.

18:18.228 --> 18:19.312
N-Now I remember!

18:19.354 --> 18:23.066
This isn't the first time Reverb
looked like a lifeless shell.

18:23.150 --> 18:24.317
That must mean…

18:29.031 --> 18:30.490
C-Could it be…

18:34.995 --> 18:38.873
BOOOOM

18:36.163 --> 18:38.206
Reverb Act 3!

18:40.250 --> 18:43.878
Um, assuming that is
who you are, sir?

18:44.588 --> 18:46.464
Awaiting orders.

18:46.631 --> 18:50.217
So that means I've matured?!

18:50.385 --> 18:53.054
You're amazing, Act 3!

18:54.931 --> 18:56.641
Awaiting orders.

18:56.683 --> 19:01.183
Er, I'm not exactly familiar with
your capabilities, so… F-For now…

19:01.980 --> 19:04.983
Protect us from harm, Act 3!

19:07.069 --> 19:11.569
Um, I mean keep us safe, please.
You can do that, right?

19:13.033 --> 19:14.367
Command acquired.

19:15.035 --> 19:15.785
DOGYAN

19:17.996 --> 19:19.831
This force!

19:21.958 --> 19:25.169
He's so incredibly fast!

19:25.212 --> 19:28.840
Act 1 and Act 2 can't
even compare!

19:34.971 --> 19:36.389
SNAP

19:39.684 --> 19:44.184
Activating… Reverb Act 3 Freeze!

19:44.689 --> 19:46.023
KERBAM BAM

19:47.025 --> 19:48.151
KERBAM BAM

19:51.071 --> 19:52.614
CRASH

19:57.577 --> 19:59.453
H-Hey, Act 3?!

19:59.538 --> 20:01.122
Formidable indeed. It's no use.

20:01.206 --> 20:02.707
It's no use?!

20:02.749 --> 20:06.002
Our foe is particularly
herculean in strength.

20:06.169 --> 20:08.171
S-H-I-T.

20:08.255 --> 20:09.714
I tried but failed.

20:11.133 --> 20:13.760
You tried but failed?
I meant what I said!

20:13.802 --> 20:15.929
I commanded you to
protect us from harm!

20:16.263 --> 20:18.640
The act of protecting
has been completed.

20:18.765 --> 20:20.433
As ordered, sir.

20:20.475 --> 20:22.727
Over here.

20:23.061 --> 20:26.022
Completed?! Like what?!

20:26.106 --> 20:30.276
You're completely useless!
You haven't made any progress at all!

20:35.740 --> 20:38.451
Over he—

20:40.704 --> 20:42.622
W-What?

20:46.960 --> 20:48.795
This is taking too long.

20:49.171 --> 20:52.549
What's holding Heart Attack back?

20:54.551 --> 20:59.051
W-What the…?
What's happening to my hand…

21:00.098 --> 21:03.601
I released Heart Attack
with my left hand, and now…

21:06.605 --> 21:10.275
Sir, is everything all right?
May I be of assistance?

21:10.317 --> 21:14.362
It's nothing.
Allow me to pay for the cup.

21:14.404 --> 21:16.364
I must be leaving,
the check please.

21:18.033 --> 21:20.326
Th-This is…

21:20.368 --> 21:23.662
M-My left hand… is so heavy!

21:25.457 --> 21:26.833
S-Sir?

21:26.875 --> 21:30.211
I-Impossible! My left hand!
My left hand has…

21:30.587 --> 21:33.298
<i>It feels like a 40 or 50
kilogram weight is pressing against it.</i>

21:33.340 --> 21:35.258
<i>What the hell's happening
over there?</i>

21:35.509 --> 21:37.552
Sir, are you all right?

21:37.594 --> 21:39.304
- Everything's just fine.
- Please, take my hand.

21:39.596 --> 21:40.555
<i>This weight!</i>

21:41.598 --> 21:45.226
What has gotten into you, sir?
I don't understand…

21:46.895 --> 21:50.023
It's been driven into the
pavement and barely moving…

21:50.148 --> 21:53.401
Act 3! What did you do?
What's your ability…

21:53.985 --> 21:55.987
3 Freeze!

21:56.071 --> 21:58.531
"Three" and "free" rhyme, don't they?

21:58.573 --> 22:01.450
Act 3, what is this power?

22:01.535 --> 22:05.413
Why is it barely moving? Tell me.

22:05.580 --> 22:09.667
If there were something
to explain, I would.

22:10.460 --> 22:12.211
<i>It's heavy…</i>

22:12.379 --> 22:16.879
<i>Somehow, something has
made Heart Attack heavy.</i>

22:17.217 --> 22:19.886
<i>Shit. I need to get it back.</i>

22:20.095 --> 22:23.890
<i>I have to go fetch
Heart Attack myself</i>

23:38.298 --> 23:41.509
EPISODE 24
HEART ATTACK, PART 2
